          "label": "Comments. You can send comments from www.irs.gov/FormComments. Or you can write to the Internal Revenue Service, Tax Forms and Publications Division, 1111 Constitution Ave. NW, IR-6526, Washington, DC 20224. DO NOT SEND THE FORM TO THIS ADDRESS. Instead, see Where To File, earlier.",
